T}
T{
\fB\-\:config\fR \fIPATH\fR
T}	T{
Configuration file for \fBvalidate\fR,\: \fBreload\fR and \fBtail\fR. Default \fB/\:etc/\:xproxy/\:xproxy.\:yaml\fR.
T}
